{"chlore":{"id":"chlore","w":"chlore","ipa":"klɔʁ","rank":17600,"forms":{"pl":"chlores"},"pos":[{"p":"n.m.","g":"m","senses":[{"zh":"氯","fr":"Élement chimique","ex":[{"fr":"Quelquefois on décape l’argent à l'acide azotique, mais il faut employer de l’acide bien exempt de chlore, qui formerait du chlorure d’argent à la surface de l’objet.","zh":"有时人们会用硝酸清洗银器，但必须使用完全不含氯的酸，否则会在物品表面生成氯化银。","src":"ai-reviewed","hl":[99,105],"ref":"A. De Plazanet, « Hydroplastie (Électro-chimie - Galvanoplastie) », chap. 38 des Études sur l’Exposition de 1867 ou Les "},{"fr":"Le chlore sert à blanchir les toiles.","zh":"氯可用于漂白布匹。","src":"ai-reviewed","hl":[3,9]}],"src":["wikt-zh","cfdict","omw","wikt-fr"],"conf":3},{"zh":"二氯；氯气","fr":"Gaz de dichlore (Cl₂) d’un vert pâle, jaunâtre et d’une odeur désagréable, toxique et irritant.","src":["wikt-zh","wikt-fr"],"conf":1},{"zh":"n.m. 氯","src":["wikt-zh"],"conf":1},{"zh":"氯原子","fr":"Atome de chlore.","reg":"技","src":["ai-reviewed"],"conf":1},{"zh":"含氯消毒剂；氯制剂","fr":"Désinfectant à base de produit chloré.","src":["ai-reviewed"],"conf":1}]}],"phrases":[{"fr":"sentir le chlore","zh":"有氯气味；有漂白水味","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1},{"fr":"eau traitée au chlore","zh":"经氯消毒的水","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1},{"fr":"galet de chlore","zh":"（游泳池用）氯消毒片","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1}],"derived":["chloroforme","chlorure","chlorate","chloral","chloroformer","chlorotique"],"frDefs":[{"p":"n.m.","gloss":"Élément chimique de numéro atomique 17 et de symbole Cl qui fait partie des halogènes."}],"sources":["ai-reviewed","cfdict","lexique","morphynet","omw","wikt-fr","wikt-zh"]},"chloroforme":{"id":"chloroforme","w":"chloroforme","ipa":"kloʁofɔʁm","rank":20446,"forms":{"pl":"chloroformes"},"pos":[{"p":"n.m.","g":"m","senses":[{"zh":"氯仿","ex":[{"fr":"Le chloroforme ou formène trichloré a été découvert en 1831 par Soubeyran en France et par Liebig en Allemagne.","zh":"氯仿（即三氯甲烷）于1831年分别由法国的苏贝朗和德国的李比希发现。","src":"ai-reviewed","hl":[3,14],"ref":"Cousin & Serres, Chimie, physique, mécanique et métallurgie dentaires, 1911"},{"fr":"La mère envoya de l’argent, mais elle joignit à son envoi un flacon de chloroforme en lui recommandant de le boire pour échapper au déshonneur.","zh":"母亲寄去了钱，但在寄出的物品中附带了一小瓶氯仿，嘱咐他喝下去以逃避耻辱。","src":"ai-reviewed","hl":[71,82],"ref":"Madeleine Pelletier, « L’Enfant (Histoire vraie) », II, Œuvres diverses, 1933, page 19"}],"src":["wikt-zh","omw"],"conf":2}]}],"phrases":[{"fr":"endormir au chloroforme","zh":"用氯仿麻醉；用氯仿迷倒","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1},{"fr":"flacon de chloroforme","zh":"氯仿瓶","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1},{"fr":"vapeurs de chloroforme","zh":"氯仿蒸气","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1}],"derived":["chlore","chlorure","chlorate","chloral","chloré","chloroformisation"],"frDefs":[{"p":"n.m.","gloss":"Nom usuel du trichlorométhane."}],"sources":["ai-reviewed","lexique","morphynet","omw","wikt-fr","wikt-zh"]},"chlorophylle":{"id":"chlorophylle","w":"chlorophylle","ipa":"kloʁofil","rank":21179,"forms":{"pl":"chlorophylles"},"pos":[{"p":"n.f.","g":"f","senses":[{"zh":"叶绿素","ex":[{"fr":"Par l’étude spectrale et par l’étude chimique, il en établit la pluralité et démontra indiscutablement qu’il n’existait pas une chlorophylle mais des chlorophylles.","zh":"通过光谱研究和化学研究，他证实了叶绿素的多样性，并无可辩驳地证明了存在的并非一种叶绿素，而是多种叶绿素。","src":"ai-reviewed","hl":[128,140],"ref":"Bulletin de la Société chimique de France, 1911"},{"fr":"La plupart des plantes que nous citerons dans cet ouvrage appartiennent au groupe des phanérogames qui sont reconnaissables par leur couleur verte due à la présence de chlorophylle.","zh":"我们在本书中将提及的大多数植物属于显花植物门，它们因含有叶绿素而呈绿色，易于辨认。","src":"ai-reviewed","hl":[168,180],"ref":"Danielle Roux, Les nouvelles plantes qui soignent, 2005"}],"src":["wikt-zh"],"conf":1},{"zh":"（转）环保政治；绿色生态主义","fr":"Écologie politique","reg":"转","src":["ai-reviewed"],"conf":1}]}],"phrases":[{"fr":"chewing-gum à la chlorophylle","zh":"叶绿素薄荷口香糖","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1},{"fr":"synthèse de la chlorophylle","zh":"叶绿素合成","src":"ai-reviewed","conf":1},